    "initial_prompt": "Whisper-style initial prompt to bias the model toward expected\nvocabulary (proper nouns, technical terms). Provider-specific support;\nsilently ignored where not applicable.",
    "language": "Optional language hint passed to the provider (ISO-639-1 like `\"en\"` /\n`\"ru\"`, or BCP-47 like `\"en-US\"` for Google). Most providers auto-detect\nwhen this is unset."
