    "opencode_cli": "OpenCode CLI tool configuration (`[opencode_cli]`).",
    "pacing": "Pacing controls for slow/local LLM workloads (`[pacing]`).",
    "peer_groups": "Named peer groups (`[peer_groups.<name>]`). Each entry binds a\nchannel, a list of member agents, and optional non-agent\n(external) members and a per-group blocklist. Mutual opt-in:\ntwo agents become peers only when both appear in the same\ngroup's `agents`. Empty by default for single-agent installs.\nSee `crate::multi_agent::PeerGroupConfig`.",
    "peripherals": "Peripheral board configuration for hardware integration (`[peripherals]`).",
    "pipeline": "Pipeline tool configuration (`[pipeline]`).",
